      "value": {
        "title": "Project rules execute under an isolated UID through bounded read-only grants",
        "owners": [
          "maplib",
          "maplibui",
          "app"
        ],
        "statement": "Only verified source-only Collector packages activate. Script contexts receive no Android, SQL, network or write access; every native query revalidates owning account, project, managed origin and fields. Before-save checks precede all feature/outbox/photo writes. Form drafts pin the complete immutable reference; failed updates retain the previous verified package and report incomplete validation. New capabilities are implemented gradually in the APK with type, CRS/unit and resource-budget contracts.\n",
        "related_code": [
          "maplib/src/main/java/com/nextgis/maplib/scripts",
          "maplibui/src/main/java/com/nextgis/maplibui/util/ProjectScriptFormController.java"
        ],
